a15('one experience supports several topics and independent issues',function()use($taxonomy,$vid){$labels=$taxonomy->labels([$vid])[$vid];eq15(count($labels['topics']),2);eq15(count($labels['issues']),1);});
a15('OR within topic group and AND between groups',function()use($atlas,$mentor,$topic,$topic2,$issue){eq15($atlas->discover(['mentor_id'=>$mentor,'topic'=>[$topic,$topic2],'issue'=>[$issue]],true)['total'],1);eq15($atlas->discover(['mentor_id'=>$mentor,'issue'=>[Security::id()]],true)['total'],0);});
